  m_text: 'This code creates a modern and interactive game rules panel with the following
    features:



    Clean and modern design with a slight hover effect



    Numbered
    rules with custom circular counters



    Smooth animations and transitions



    Responsive
    design that works on mobile devices



    Highlighted keywords using a different
    color



    Subtle shadow effects for depth



    Gradient background for the
    page



    Custom font using Google Fonts (Poppins)



    Hover effects on
    list items



    Card-like panel with rounded cornerjn

    kokop

'
